<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 71.1396 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 71.1396 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 71.1396 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday from 71.6145 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 22		  Nov 21</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  71.1396		 71.6145</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	    14.645		   6.280</p>
<p>				    Nov 22		  Nov 20</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.9000		 47.5000</p>
<p>    volume ( DM million)	   0.010		   0.015</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509 410</p>
</text>
